  "case": "PostgreSQL smallint[] and integer[] XLSX re-import preserve signed boundaries, NULL, and lower bounds through LibreOffice Calc",
  "test": "array_contract::value_contract_integer_arrays_file_exports_preserve_bounds_for_calc_reimport",
  "engine": "PostgreSQL Docker integration fixture",
  "contract": [
    "The smallint[] fixture uses lower bound zero and includes -32768, 0, 32767 and SQL NULL; the integer[] fixture uses lower bound two and includes -2147483648, values adjacent to the binary32 exactness boundary, 2147483647 and SQL NULL.",
    "pg_typeof, array_to_json and array_send provide native type, semantic and wire-byte oracles; typed text rebinding preserves both array JSON and wire bytes.",
    "Both XLSX result cells are shared strings with exact array text and no formulas.",
    "LibreOffice Calc opens XLSX and saves ODS, then reopens ODS and saves XLSX; exact A2/B2 text and string cell kinds remain unchanged."
